rrentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const gradientXOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; gradientX: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const gradientYOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; gradientY: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const gradientValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; gradientValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const settingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; settings: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const slopeValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; slopeValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const aspectValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; aspectValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const hillshadeValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"18\">@group(0) @binding(6) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; hillshadeValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const WIDTH: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const PI: f32 = 3.141592653589793;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const DEGREES_TO_RADIANS: f32 = 0.017453292519943295;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">const RADIANS_TO_DEGREES: f32 = 57.29577951308232;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">const ROW_NORTH_SIGN: f32 = -1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">fn getGroundCellSize(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(settings[settingsOffset + 0u], settings[settingsOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  return cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"33\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"34\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  _ = &amp;gradientX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  _ = &amp;gradientY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  _ = &amp;gradientValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  _ = &amp;settings;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  _ = &amp;slopeValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  _ = &amp;aspectValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  _ = &amp;hillshadeValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let row = index / WIDTH;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let rawX = gradientX[gradientXOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let rawY = gradientY[gradientYOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let groundCell = getGroundCellSize(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  let zFactor = settings[settingsOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  // Sobel responds 8 to a unit-per-pixel ramp, so Horn&#39;s derivative is raw / (8 * cell).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  let eastGradient = zFactor * rawX / (8.0 * groundCell.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  let northGradient = ROW_NORTH_SIGN * zFactor * rawY / (8.0 * groundCell.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let larger = max(abs(eastGradient), abs(northGradient));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let smaller = min(abs(eastGradient), abs(northGradient));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  var gradientMagnitude = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  if (larger &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    let ratio = smaller / larger;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    gradientMagnitude = larger * sqrt(1.0 + ratio * ratio);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  let isValid = gradientValidity[gradientValidityOffset + index] != 0u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">    isFiniteValue(rawX) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(rawY) &amp;&amp; groundCell.x &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; groundCell.y &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    isFiniteValue(eastGradient) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(northGradient) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(gradientMagnitude);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let invalidValue = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  let slope = atan(gradientMagnitude) * RADIANS_TO_DEGREES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  slopeValues[slopeValuesOffset + index] = select(invalidValue, slope, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  var aspect = -1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  if (gradientMagnitude &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">    aspect = atan2(-eastGradient, -northGradient) * RADIANS_TO_DEGREES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    if (aspect &lt; 0.0) { aspect += 360.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    if (aspect &gt;= 360.0) { aspect -= 360.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  aspectValues[aspectValuesOffset + index] = select(invalidValue, aspect, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let azimuth = settings[settingsOffset + 3u] * DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let altitude = settings[settingsOffset + 4u] * DEGREES_TO_RADIANS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let light = vec3&lt;f32&gt;(sin(azimuth) * cos(altitude), cos(azimuth) * cos(altitude), sin(altitude));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  let normal = normalize(vec3&lt;f32&gt;(-eastGradient, -northGradient, 1.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  let shade = max(dot(normal, light), 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  hillshadeValues[hillshadeValuesOffset + index] = select(invalidValue, shade, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>gradientX<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-derivatives-gradient-x-values\">terrain-derivatives-gradient-x-values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>gradientY<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-derivatives-gradient-y-values\">terrain-derivatives-gradient-y-values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>gradientValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-derivatives-gradient-x-validity\">terrain-derivatives-gradient-x-validity</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>settings<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"derivatives-parameters\">derivatives-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>slopeValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"slope\">slope</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>aspectValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"aspect\">aspect</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>hillshadeValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"hillshade\">hillshade</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTerrainDerivatives/shade-uniform · main · 60731b06</figcaption></figure></section>",
